p1 meta lang.pattern.p1 stated "show a kanban board in the terminal => concept board.intro \"kanban board tool\"" @gen:c0cb5c1eeaaf9751
p2 meta lang.pattern.p2 stated "read the board from the file named on the command line, or from standard input when no file is named => concept board.input \"reads file arg or stdin\"" @gen:c0cb5c1eeaaf9751
p3 meta lang.pattern.p3 stated "the board is markdown: <desc.words> => concept board.format \"<desc>\"" @gen:c0cb5c1eeaaf9751
p4 meta lang.pattern.p4 stated "the board has the columns <cols> => fact board.columns \"<cols>\"" @gen:c0cb5c1eeaaf9751
p5 meta lang.pattern.p5 stated "print one line per column: <desc.words> => concept board.print \"<desc>\"" @gen:c0cb5c1eeaaf9751
p6 meta lang.pattern.p6 stated "a column with no cards prints its name and the colon only => concept board.empty \"empty column format\"" @gen:c0cb5c1eeaaf9751
p7 meta lang.pattern.p7 stated "install the tool as the command <cmd> => fact install.command.<cmd> \"<cmd>\"" @gen:c0cb5c1eeaaf9751
p8 meta lang.pattern.p8.under.p7 stated "given the lines \"<l1>\", \"<l2>\", \"<l3>\", <l4> and \"<l5>\", print the lines \"<o1>\", <o2> and <o3> => fact board.example.<cmd> \"<l1> <l2> <l3> <l4> <l5> <o1> <o2> <o3>\"" @gen:c0cb5c1eeaaf9751
